---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
import { getLangFromUrl, localizePath } from '../i18n';

const currentLang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const cookiePath = localizePath('/cookie-policy.html', currentLang);
const contactPath = localizePath('/contact.html', currentLang);

const pageHeader = '<meta http-equiv="x-ua-compatible" content="ie=edge">\n<title>Privacy Policy &amp; GDPR/KVKK | Continex Global</title>\n<meta name="description" content="How Continex Global collects, uses, and protects personal data under GDPR and KVKK.">';
const bodyClass = 'theme-finances';
---
<BaseLayout pageHeader={pageHeader} bodyClass={bodyClass}>
  <main>
    <section class="cx-legal-ptb tp-sec-ptb pt-140 pb-120">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="row justify-content-center">
          <div class="col-lg-9">
            <article class="cx-legal-content">
              <h2 class="cx-legal-page-title">Privacy Policy &amp; GDPR/KVKK</h2>
              <p class="cx-legal-meta">Last updated: August 2026</p>

              <h3>1. Data Controller</h3>
              <p>
                Continex Global (“we”, “us”, “our”) is the data controller for personal data processed through this website and related business communications.
              </p>
              <ul>
                <li>Company: Continex Global</li>
                <li>Address: 19 Mayıs Mah. 19 Mayıs Cad. Nova Baran Plaza No:4 K:13, 34360 Şişli / Istanbul, Türkiye</li>
                <li>Email: <a href="mailto:info@continexglobal.com">info@continexglobal.com</a></li>
                <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+902123474756113">0212 347 47 56 - 113</a></li>
              </ul>

              <h3>2. Scope</h3>
              <p>
                This Privacy Policy explains how we process personal data of website visitors, prospective clients, partners, and other contacts in accordance with:
              </p>
              <ul>
                <li>EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR)</li>
                <li>Turkish Personal Data Protection Law No. 6698 (KVKK)</li>
              </ul>

              <h3>3. Personal Data We Collect</h3>
              <p>Depending on how you interact with us, we may process:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Identity and contact details (name, email, phone, company, job title)</li>
                <li>Messages and inquiry details submitted via contact forms</li>
                <li>Technical data (IP address, browser type, device information, pages visited)</li>
                <li>Cookie and analytics data, where permitted (see our <a href={cookiePath}>Cookie Policy</a>)</li>
              </ul>

              <h3>4. Purposes of Processing</h3>
              <p>We process personal data to:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Respond to inquiries and manage business communications</li>
                <li>Provide market-entry, partnership, and advisory related services</li>
                <li>Operate, secure, and improve our website</li>
                <li>Comply with legal obligations and defend legal claims</li>
                <li>Send updates where you have given consent or where soft opt-in rules apply</li>
              </ul>

              <h3>5. Legal Bases</h3>
              <p>Depending on the activity, processing may rely on:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Your consent (Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR / KVKK Art. 5)</li>
                <li>Performance of a contract or pre-contractual steps (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR)</li>
                <li>Compliance with a legal obligation (Art. 6(1)(c) GDPR)</li>
                <li>Legitimate interests, such as website security and business development communications, balanced against your rights (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR)</li>
              </ul>

              <h3>6. Sharing and Transfers</h3>
              <p>
                We do not sell personal data. We may share data with service providers that support hosting, email, analytics, or IT operations, under appropriate confidentiality and data-processing terms. Where data is transferred outside the EEA or Türkiye, we apply suitable safeguards such as contractual protections.
              </p>

              <h3>7. Retention</h3>
              <p>
                We retain personal data only as long as needed for the purposes above, including applicable limitation periods and legal record-keeping requirements. Contact form inquiries are typically reviewed and retained for a limited business period unless a longer relationship or legal need arises.
              </p>

              <h3>8. Your Rights (GDPR / KVKK)</h3>
              <p>Subject to applicable law, you may request to:</p>
              <ul>
                <li>Access your personal data</li>
                <li>Rectify inaccurate data</li>
                <li>Erase data (“right to be forgotten”)</li>
                <li>Restrict or object to processing</li>
                <li>Receive data portability where applicable</li>
                <li>Withdraw consent at any time without affecting prior lawful processing</li>
              </ul>
              <p>
                To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@continexglobal.com">info@continexglobal.com</a>. You may also lodge a complaint with the Turkish Personal Data Protection Authority (KVKK) or your local supervisory authority in the EU/EEA.
              </p>

              <h3>9. Security</h3>
              <p>
                We apply organizational and technical measures designed to protect personal data against unauthorized access, loss, misuse, or alteration. No online transmission method is completely secure; we continuously improve our controls.
              </p>

              <h3>10. Cookies and Tracking</h3>
              <p>
                We use essential cookies and, with your consent, optional analytics/marketing cookies. Details are available in our <a href={cookiePath}>Cookie Policy</a>. You can manage preferences through the cookie consent banner.
              </p>

              <h3>11. Updates</h3>
              <p>
                We may update this Privacy Policy periodically. The “Last updated” date at the top of this page will change when revisions are published.
              </p>

              <h3>12. Contact</h3>
              <p>
                For privacy questions or data subject requests, email <a href="mailto:info@continexglobal.com">info@continexglobal.com</a> or use our <a href={contactPath}>Contact</a> page.
              </p>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>

<style is:global>
  .cx-legal-content {
    color: var(--tp-finance-secondary);
  }
  .cx-legal-page-title {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 42px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.42px;
    color: var(--tp-finance-secondary);
  }
  .cx-legal-meta {
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    font-size: 14px;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }
  .cx-legal-content h3 {
    margin: 42px 0 16px;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.28px;
    color: var(--tp-finance-secondary);
  }
  .cx-legal-content p,
  .cx-legal-content li {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: rgba(24, 52, 87, 0.82);
  }
  .cx-legal-content p {
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .cx-legal-content ul {
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .cx-legal-content li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .cx-legal-content a {
    color: var(--tp-finance-secondary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
  .cx-legal-content a:hover {
    opacity: 0.75;
  }
</style>
